    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60232" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύ̆-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>icy
