				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				494
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				368c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.181d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἰσχυρόν</span>”
